      "description": "Your everyday shortcut to calm, hydrated, glowing skin 💕\n\nEach pad is soaked with a gentle yet powerful essence made with:\n🌿 Centella, Oat, Rice & Cucumber to soothe, calm and even skin tone\n💧 Niacinamide + Zinc PCA to balance oil, reduce breakouts & strengthen skin barrier\n✨ PHA + Licorice for smooth, bright, radiant glow\n🛡️ Panthenol & Squalane to lock in lasting hydration\n\n\n\nWhy you’ll love it:\n✔ Alcohol-free, fragrance-free & vegan\n✔ Gentle enough for daily use\n✔ Suitable for all skin types — dry, oily, sensitive, acne-prone & combination\n✔ Safe for teens, adults, TTC, pregnant & breastfeeding moms\n\nOne pad, endless glow 🌸 Swipe your way to pure, healthy skin with Mooi PureGlow Soothing Pad.\n\nIngredients (INCI):\nAqua (Water), Niacinamide (4%), Gluconolactone (3%), Panthenol, Oryza Sativa (Rice) Extract, Cucumis Sativus (Cucumber) Fruit Extract, Avena Sativa (Oat) Kernel Extract, Centella Asiatica Extract, Glycereth-26, Squalane, Glycyrrhiza Glabra (Licorice) Root Extract, Zinc PCA, Betaine, 1,2-Hexanediol, Tocopheryl Acetate, Allantoin, Trehalose, Hydroxyethyl Urea, Hydroxyacetophenone, Hydrogenated Lecithin, Dipotassium Glycyrrhizate, Polyglyceryl-10 Laurate, Octyldodeceth-16, Xanthan Gum, Hydroxyethylcellulose, Disodium EDTA.\n",
